{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f21d0bf41d58c32068b191d271d5684ced77e3b0c692949c908c1d4e8bd0e721","ja":"魂のうどん作り","zh":"灵魂乌冬面制作","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"15b1b726af0aeaa7cc3524d3ef4320cf8f5048ce07eef07fc1921344225e9cf3","ja":"今日の真と静香のお仕事は、料理番組の出演。\nゲストに手料理を披露することになっていて……","zh":"今天真和静香的工作是出演烹饪节目。\n她们要在节目中向嘉宾大显身手，展示亲手做的料理……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"44bd291c9ff6d227a2c7722d532d134d0ea3879b49541084f6d57e9f7f0a3b46","ja":"「今日の料理人は、菊地真さんと最上静香さんです！\nまずは、今日の意気込みをお願いします！」","zh":"“今天的厨师是菊地真和最上静香！\n首先请两位说说今天的干劲吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e9e5441351a01f2bc57681684af1bd0d805b86d1b41dab17c3799e2046e11a63","ja":"はい！　同じうどんを愛する者として、\n最高の一杯をごちそうしたいです！","zh":"好的！作为同样热爱乌冬面的人，\n我想请您吃上一碗最棒的乌冬面！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"78d9ffa739449f1d7b4125763a3439aebfa76e2a45c30e06822317b06f724904","ja":"静香、すごい気迫だね！\nこのパワーに負けないように、ボクも頑張ります！","zh":"静香，好强大的气魄啊！\n为了不输给这股气势，我也要加油了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"36ccd410f51f12e3528a932e59415d523516ac6e81a474ebc8fd7704eedbf344","ja":"「これは頼もしい！　では、早速始めてください！」","zh":"“真是靠得住啊！那么，请马上开始吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0e73cd8145fec1781e3aee8e87e112cba65abdd2d245b877707ebc6c01fd3a1f","ja":"「さて、今回のお題はうどんですが……\nおっ、手つきが慣れてますね～！」","zh":"「那么，这次的题目是乌冬面……\n哦，手法相当熟练呢～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2757618695660d3c9cf3c52f85841dbdb43b3483bbb4a3e7017834abeb0b6cac","ja":"今まで、何度もこねてきましたから……！\n生地作りから、こだわっていきます！","zh":"毕竟至今为止，我已经揉过无数次面了……！\n我会从制作面团开始就精益求精的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8e8e15b78fcb34d0192f2358a9b54b4b531dde75a7cb18fe81fa3b98b387f5e6","ja":"静香、生地はボクがこねるよ！\n力仕事なら任せて！","zh":"静香，面团由我来揉吧！\n力气活就包在我身上！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a1efaa59994d4262ae2511b25491bcaba020a150415a83fc84f0c8f5137617b5","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nでは私は、出汁の下ごしらえをしますね！","zh":"谢谢！\n那我这就去准备高汤！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f24dd5a51f58ec7f9c526d073503b4168230ed3696ece1e8870d663adfdb4684","ja":"（かつお節を薄くけずって……\n出汁のうまみが充分に出るように、たっぷりと！）","zh":"（把柴鱼削得薄薄的……\n为了充分煮出高汤的鲜美，得多放一些才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a5e6226dc92b12c147dc1ccd5e01528aa0f32eb579dbdea9c11d9353cf1063b0","ja":"わぁ……静香の集中力、すごいなぁ！\nボクもしっかりこねて……と！","zh":"哇……静香的专注力好厉害啊！\n我也要好好揉……好啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"427dfd9beb453b499f6961609f16654aace65564055415294126a530a8b8899a","ja":"「全身全霊で料理に取り組まれるおふたり！\nこれは、期待大ですね！」","zh":"“全身心投入到烹饪中的两位！\n这可真是太令人期待了呢！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5c373fe1587cd97f2a98d7a2a9c68207601ab7e6c26689db4c71d79f50cab056","ja":"（うん、とても深みのある出汁ができた……！\nこれならきっとおいしいうどんが……）","zh":"（嗯，熬出了味道非常醇厚的高汤……！\n这样肯定能做出好吃的乌冬面……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"dc71082964eaa418d1143e1e68888af5168df010a33edb8939bedf43f055a39b","ja":"静香！　うどんの生地って\nこれくらいで大丈夫？","zh":"静香！乌冬面团揉成\n这样就可以了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c49f3b722625981a626fc31bf51314d2dbd748c40cfaaf92cf15a75c9cf80350","ja":"そうですね、それくらいこねてあれば。\n後はしばらく寝かせて……。","zh":"是呢，揉到这种程度的话就可以了。\n接下来静置一会儿……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1585.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c4a8d30aece3e1888f3f06b45b6fb04b778c921065b545b58ca70f5c340aafc7","ja":"（あっ……でも、本当にこれでいいのかしら？　もっと\n食べる人への気遣いを追及するべきなんじゃ……？）","zh":"（啊……不过，真的这样就好吗？是不是应该\n更进一步为享用的人着想呢……？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
